Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted).
Upstream status: not submitted.
The genesys backend uses std::back_inserter in device.cpp and
std::uncaught_exception in error.cpp without including <iterator> and
<exception>. Newer libc++ no longer provides them through other standard
headers, so the cross build stopped with "no member named
'back_inserter' in namespace 'std'". Include the headers.

